{"beat": 40, "name": "WHEN THE PRICE IS THE BRAND", "text": "And sometimes the price is the brand, the way the dime was. A product sold as a gift under a round number. A line that's always the cheapest, or always the premium one. That's a real asset, and Printers' Ink was right about it: a price can be an advertising idea. But treat it like one. An advertising idea has a cost, and you'd measure any other advertising. Know what holding the line costs you in margin each month, the same way you'd know what a campaign costs, and decide on purpose whether it's worth it. Woolworth's successors held theirs until it stopped them selling what their customers wanted. You can know long before that.", "provider": "placeholder", "words": [{"word": "And", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.16}, {"word": "sometimes", "start": 0.16, "end": 0.56}, {"word": "the", "start": 0.56, "end": 0.9}, {"word": "price", "start": 0.9, "end": 1.26}, {"word": "is", "start": 1.26, "end": 1.46}, {"word": "the", "start": 1.46, "end": 1.6}, {"word": "brand,", "start": 1.6, "end": 2.02}, {"word": "the", "start": 2.28, "end": 2.4}, {"word": "way", "start": 2.4, "end": 2.56}, {"word": "the", "start": 2.56, "end": 2.72}, {"word": "dime", "start": 2.72, "end": 3.08}, {"word": "was.", "start": 3.08, "end": 3.42}, {"word": "A", "start": 4.08, "end": 4.2}, {"word": "product", "start": 4.2, "end": 4.56}, {"word": "sold", "start": 4.56, "end": 4.96}, {"word": "as", "start": 4.96, "end": 5.2}, {"word": "a", "start": 5.2, "end": 5.32}, {"word": "gift", "start": 5.32, "end": 5.62}, {"word": "under", "start": 5.62, "end": 5.92}, {"word": "a", "start": 5.92, "end": 6.14}, {"word": "round", "start": 6.14, "end": 6.4}, {"word": "number.", "start": 6.4, "end": 6.82}, {"word": "A", "start": 7.3, "end": 7.52}, {"word": "line", "start": 7.52, "end": 7.82}, {"word": "that's", "start": 7.82, "end": 8.2}, {"word": "always", "start": 8.2, "end": 8.56}, {"word": "the", "start": 8.56, "end": 8.8}, {"word": "cheapest,", "start": 8.8, "end":